# Claude framework — never commit (SEC-07)
#
# The rule: anything an sbdev process emits ABOUT THE STATE OF THE WORK stays
# local. Docs that record what to build (prd, architecture, constraints,
# plan-*) are committed deliberately; docs that record how far short of it we
# currently are — findings, untested surfaces, session state — are a map of
# this specific site's weak points and belong nowhere public.
